==== sample 1: Volkanovski vs Gaethje, 5 rounds at lightweight (seed 4242)
Justin Gaethje def. Alexander Volkanovski by TKO, at 2:44 of round 1.
  R1 5:00  Alexander Volkanovski vs Justin Gaethje, a five-round title fight at lightweight. UFC records: Volkanovski 16-3, Gaethje 11-5. Volkanovski in the blue corner, Gaethje in the red.
  R1 4:28  Gaethje reads the level change and sprawls.
  R1 4:22  Volkanovski keeps hold after the shot and pins Gaethje on the fence.
  R1 2:16  Volkanovski crumples from a knee to the ribs to the body! Volkanovski had been knocked down four times before in the UFC.
  R1 2:16  Gaethje jumps on top of Volkanovski!
  R1 2:16  Gaethje pours on the hammerfists and the referee dives in!
  R1 2:16  Justin Gaethje wins by TKO at 2:44 of round 1. It's the eighth KO or TKO win of Gaethje's UFC career.

